# Pairs with TypeOK. Records a watermark past the HLC domain.
MODULE: TypeOkLowWatermarkRunaway
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the recorded watermark leaves its domain
PERTURBS: Heartbeat
BOUNDS: Parts = {1}

--- FIND
    /\ srcv' = SOf
    /\ Rearm
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: out of domain.
    /\ srcv' = SOf + Top
    /\ Rearm
--- END
